  <book code="1TI" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:45 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Ti-mô-thê Thưq yưk</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Phao-lô, adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu tyauq tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk, Wơơt Lôôk haay, ji ku Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, xuum takôô gamưh ku haay, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />atăq ka Ti-mô-thê, koot dik ku gô đom xuum tuôq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 1:2">Apôôy koot jah vanong plêêk, varơuq biit angơuq, hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Đaji tuôôy dưk hooy truh Ma-xê-đoan, gô heq ahluk nhăk koot măn hlê aduq Ê-phê-sô xôq koot hnoq ik pato dăt taleq adro hơq leh pato apok ganuun kadrơy, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />kung te tabông truh kaluh apok taboon leh e ji kaluh rahlăp adrơơk katôôl leh xet dêq, laa kaluh thưq taway truh varơuq takaay tayaat, iaq laa varơuq xakaq jư hnhư Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq dơơp đom xuum tuôq. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Bơh muk tiêu ku apok tanưưl neq laa xung xiaq vlôh xing xuum pa xarêh ji xuum klaak kaxay kung dii xuum tuôq dong dik, <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />đơu muuyq sôôq adro, vii leh troq muk tiêu, heq wiit ka'lăk xôq wih truh varơuq tagêh vlô apoop, <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />trôôch dơơp thơy pato ganuun, tuôôy be hlolh leh vơ kaluh apok oot đnooy đơu măn truh kaluh varơuq oot tuôq kajưk.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Lunư, haay xet đaneq ganuun laa kaxay tamaq atoh khơl drơy xok dơơp ni kach troq jơq, <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />vii xet varơuq neq, nưq laa ganuun leh jah xôq vlôh ka manih hyioh jăk, đơu ka adro leh e ganuun ji leh dơơp tyauq, adro leh kuh vado ji kadrôôp maroh, adro leh e đaauq ji đnooy ra ơơh, adro păk kaxêêt vaq ji păk kaxêêt miq, adro păk kaxêêt manih, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />khơl apuq atrăp, khơl kanau trôôch khơl kanau, khơl rôp tek manih, khơl đnooy pa ôôh, khơl dơơp xanưk lar, ji dêq hloay adro leq đêh tachơơl hlê dii varơuq pato dayq kaxay tamaq <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />troq tyauq Hêêl Kaxay tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk vanong kaxay, laa varơuq đơu gô heq jah pahnăp.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Gô kuh kway Kơy kahniq paraat ka gô, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, vii Kadraq heq xadrah gô laa đangq tuôq gamưh, tuôôy xôq gô muut hơu varơuq, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />ju adroyq hơq gô laa adro đnooy katơơk galơh, rôp toop ji xơk tauq, bơh gô heq jah biit angơuq vii đong tuôôy leh hlolh xet, gô heq dưk dơơp đom varơuq be tuôq. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Bơh, vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay laa thier galơh galaay kung dii xuum tuôq ji xuum xung xiaq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Apok padoh neq laa đangq tuôq ji đangq nhonq xok dêq hloay, nưq laa: “Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu heq truh đom dêh araak xôq wơơt manih kadrôôp” — đơu đom nưq gô laa adro dưk ưk. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Lunư, gô heq jah biit angơuq vii kakơq neq, nưq laa xôq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh dêq hloay xuum atuq đom gô, adro kadrôôp maroh dơơp ưk, đaji muuyq atoh ka khơl adro hnoq tuôq aduq Kadraq xôq jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Apôôy varơuq vado vanê ji tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Vuua ku tôôy đơơy xanưm, laa Kơy Plêêk vơ muuyq leh kaxêêt hlơơp, leh hloq ik, dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Ti-mô-thê, koot gô, gô pahnăp apok tanưưl neq ka koot, tyauq kaluh apok hlit adroyq neq truh koot, xôq gamưh kaluh apok nưq, koot hnoq ik hooy vlôh đom varơuq tahmơt kaxay xaleep, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />tuôôy adrơk jư xuum tuôq ji xuum klaak kaxay, đơu muuyq sôôq manih, vii chôôyq ka'lăk, heq dơơp karăp xuum tuôq oot, <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />đom sôôq nưq laa Hi-mê-nê ji A-lek-xan-đơ, laa khơl adro đơu gô heq pahnăp ka Sa-tan xôq ka baarq hnoq ik jah pato dayq xôq leh huq đnooy katơơk galơh.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Vii anưq, adroyq dêq, gô ahluk hluul kaluh apok apôôy vôôch, apôôy, apôôy thay, kuh kway duh jah tơơk tưp tok ka tôôy adro, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />ka khơl vuua ji dêq hloay khơl leq đong măn đom aduq qwuyen lưk, xôq haay hnoq ik riirh đom đơơy hrok hrol ji langưưp paat dii tôôy varơuq tuôq kuh kul ji xuum kaxay. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Nưq laa varơuq kaxay tamaq ji jơq dik kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, Wơơt Lôôk haay, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />laa Kơy trôôch tôôy adro jah wơơt ji hooy truh aduq nhonq xet varơuq dik. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Vii vơ e muuyq Kơy Plêêk ji muuyq Kơy kaplah katul Kơy Plêêk ji koot manih — nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, muuyq koot manih, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Kơy heq pahnăp kadih kadraq dơơp jaq wơơt ka tôôy manih, đaji apok xanưk muut klip kawat, <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />vii apok xanưk nưq đơu gô heq jah lâp dơơp adro padoh taboon đaauq ji adro jah rơơlh — gô đnooy dik đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, gô leh đnooy pa ôôh — 'ngưq laa dơơp thơy pato ka kaluh tamooy kadrơy truh xuum tuôq ji varơuq dik.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Vii anưq, gô trôôch khơl kanau măn loch aduq pheq apôôy, tơơk ti vah xarêh tok leh taway tyauq varơuq tôq jaraq ji takaay tayaat, <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />dang anưq, khơl oh ay kadrê pheq dơơp kaxay kadih xăk đom qwuân aau goh gaat dii xuum xet vado ji jư xăk, leh aalq bơơn varơuq voot hlôôk kung dii vajang long ngok, long qwuân aau kanaq jêêt, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />đơu bơơn varơuq taxưngq dii manih khơl kadrê đnooy vlôh xuum kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk gamưh kaluh varơuq kaxay.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Khơl kadrê pheq hok vôôch đom hnhep, đom varơuq tameng tyauq dêq hloay. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Panưh kadrơy, gô leh ăm pheep khơl kadrê pato dayq long adrơk qwuyen tol khơl kanau, đơu pheq hnhep. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Vii A-đam heq jah pajêêk vlôh adroyq, yôôch đơơu truh Ê-va, <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />ji A-đam leh biq adô aluut, bơh khơl kadrê, tuôôy dêq hloay biq adô aluut, heq hooy truh aduq lôp kadrôôp. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Lunư, khơl kadrê hnoq jah wơơt gamưh varơuq pa iir koot, atoh đaji oot kưq măn đom xuum tuôq, xuum xung xiaq ji varơuq hlăng vah, dii xuum biit xarêh xaraat.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Apok neq laa đangq tuôq gamưh: “Atoh akơyq nưq trôôch dơơp adro xakaq bơy, yôôych adro nưq trôôch xung muuyq varơuq kaxay tamaq.” <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Lunưq, adro xakaq bơy pheq laa adro leh e aduq đnooy ik, kanau ku muuyq kadrê, rơơt rol, jư xăk, tanưưl tanăp, tiip đoonq tamooy kadrơy, e paraat pato dayq, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />leh gien lok, leh te tagay, đơu pheq e xuum tamaq, tagu, leh hmưch jêêt, <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />jư 'yo tolh hnhư ni, e koot xau tameng tyauq dii dêq hloay xuum kuh vado <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(vii atoh muuyq adro leh xet kach jư 'yo hnhư ni, yôôych adro nưq hnoq jư 'yo Tayuup Vah ku Kơy Plêêk đaji đaleq?), <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />leh ik laa adro đơơu tuôq, xôq leh huq vii kơq atok xăk katơơk galơh đơu adro nưq gưlh muut varơuq xưh xadrah đaji kamuuych. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Wih hlê, manih jư 'yo kung pheq e apok xanưk kaxay xing manih pi gôk Tayuup Vah, xôq manih nưq leh huq klêh muut varơuq đnooy ra ơơh ji vơơt rayaalh ku kamuuych.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Dang anưq, khơl châp sưq pheq dong dik, leh đnooy vaarq apok, leh ik gien lok, leh hmưch trôôch, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />jư 'yo varơuq kadook padu ku xuum tuôq bơơn xuum klaak pa xarêh. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Panưh kadrơy, oot kung pheq jah thư arieq adroyq, yôôch atêq nưq dayh xôq oot hơu varơuq tuôôy leh biq aduq đnooy trek.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Khơl adro kadrê kung anưq, pheq dong troq, leh đnooy xơuq, jư xăk, muuyq xuum đom tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Khơl châp sưq pheq laa kanau ku muuyq kadrê, jư 'yo tolh koot xau ji dêq hnhư oot. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Vii khơl adro hơu varơuq hyioh jăk xagook xuq ka oot vii anưq kaxay tamaq ji 'ngưng varơuq kôk kalh đom xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Gô valơk taleq apok neq ka koot, trôôch truh hlơq koot thier meel, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />bơh atoh gô manưưn truh, yôôych koot hnoq ik xet pheq dưk dơơp đaleq đom hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu nưq laa Tayuup Vah ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, xadrưk ji gok chơơl đơ ku varơuq dik. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Varơuq kadook padu truh varơuq tuôq kuh kul dik laa kôt galơh leh ik tajauq takaay, laa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">“Kơy jah kahnoq vlôh đom xăk xamơk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jah xưng hyioh jăk đom Kơy Phool Hiel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jah 'yo hloq xing yaak plêêk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jah padoh taboon katul kaluh tamooy,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jah tuôq gamưh tol dêh araak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jah taway tok đom tađnah tađnaak.”<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh ro raang đaneq đom katuôôy đơơy atêq neq, 'ngưng adro hnoq ka'lăk xuum tuôq, charơơk tyauq kaluh garu xi aluut pa ôôh ji apok pato ku kamuuych, <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />đom varơuq dơơp bôô ku bing pa ôôh lar, xuum klaak ku bing nưq heq biq găk gulq, <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />tuôôy leh ăm vôôch pajêêk, đooy deek kaluh tuôông xa đơu Kơy Plêêk dơơp vlôh xôq nhonq xok dii xuum xet kuh kway xing manih tuôq gamưh ji hlolh xet varơuq dik. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Vii tôôy paroh ku Kơy Plêêk laa kaxay tamaq, ji be e paroh kajoq đangq vih ka'lăk tuôôy jah nhonq xok dii xuum xet kuh kway, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />vii tuôông xa jah vah xarêh gamưh apok Kơy Plêêk ji apok apôôy.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Tuôôy xôq kaluh varơuq nưq kangưưr oh ay, koot hnoq laa xapok hyioh jăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, jah văch xiap xing apok ku xuum tuôq ji pato dayq kaxay tamaq đơu koot heq tameng tyauq. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Bơh dayh chôôyq ka'lăk kaluh varơuq taboon leh e dêh araak ku taleq adro mo karaq. Tađôôy muut đnư, dayh atuq arieq kadih koot ka varơuq tuôq kuh kul, <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />vii “varơuq atuq arieq xăk xamơk yôôych ich lơơy đom kawat lêq, bơh varơuq atuq arieq xuum tuôq kuh kul yôôych ich lơơy ka tôôy varơuq, vii e apok tavek ka đơơy neq ji đơơy têq.” <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Apok nưq laa đangq tuôq gamưh ji đangq đoonq nhonq dêq hloay, <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />vii haay pơq galeh ji tahmơt tagoa ka varơuq neq, vii haay xôq xuum takôô gamưh aduq Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, Kadraq laa Wơơt Lôôk ku tôôy adro, nhưk laa ku khơl tuôq.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Dayh padoh dăt ji pato dayq kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Te xôq akơyq 'yo leh ra kajoq tuuyh tadăp ku koot, đơu dayh jêêk vlôh ramil ka khơl tuôq, đom apok đnooy, đom kach xa thêêk, đom xuum xung xiaq, đom xuum tuôq, đom varơuq xarêh xaraat. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Dayh tabông muut varơuq đok rahlăp, đnooy panhăk, pato dayq dong truh tuôôy gô truh. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Te ka'lăk tăk vanong măn đom koot, laa vanong heq jah kahniq ka koot xing apok hlit, kung dii varơuq xôq ti ku khơl draq.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Dayh atuq arieq kaluh varơuq nưq, dayh tabông muut varơuq nưq, xôq varơuq kôt tok ku koot jêêk vlôh ro raang đôôyq dii tôôy adro. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Dayh rơơt rol 'yo hlê kadih xăk koot ji kông varơuq pato dayq. Dayh wêêt kajưk đom kaluh varơuq nưq, vii dơơp anưq koot hnoq wơơt kaah kadih xăk koot hloay khơl adro tameng koot.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Leh duh parêq apok dii khơl kơy kôt tuuyh, bơh dayh đnooy panhăk adro nưq đaji vaq, khơl blaay yôôych đaji oh ay, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />khơl mo kôt tuuyh yôôych đaji miq, khơl drê tadăp yôôych đaji oh ay, đom varơuq pa xarêh xaleep.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Dayh vado khơl mo valơu — khơl mo valơu dong dik. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Bơh atoh mo valơu leq e koot long xau, yôôych adroyq nhưk koot xau oot pheq hok xôq xet vado khơl hnhư ku kadih xăk, ji kahnoq xuum bla vanong hlê ka khơl miq vaq nưq, vii neq laa varơuq jơq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Lunư, manih mo valơu dong dik ji vơ muuyq xăk muuyq adro, yôôych takôô kôô aduq Kơy Plêêk ji kưq wêêt kajưk đom varơuq apôôy vôôch ji apôôy klôôy hngơy. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Măn adro axek akhiim varơuq xa agưt yôôch heq kaxêêt, ju đong măn riirh. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Kung dayh đnooy hlê kaluh apok tanưưl neq, xôq oot hnoq ik leh e aduq leq đangq toah. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Bơh atoh akơyq nưq leh văch xiap ka khơl oh ay, đơu nhưk laa khơl hnhư ni, yôôych adro nưq heq chôôyq ka'lăk xuum tuôq ji laa adro têq iaq adro leh tuôq.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Muuyq mo valơu duh pheq jah valơk anơng yôôych leh axit iaq drơu kưl tuuyh, laa kadrê ku muuyq kanau, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />jah 'yo xanưk xing kaluh varơuq kaxay: mo e văch pato koot xau be, mo e tiip đoonq tamooy xangưưy be, mo e 'nhaau jôôk khơl vah be, mo e wơơt waak adro pơơl hwơơl be, mo e dêq xuum dii tôôy varơuq kaxay be.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Bơh dayh kadih chôôyq khơl mo valơu măn blaay, vii tuôôy varơuq hmưch trôôch apuq atrăp ahluk tok tachơơl hlê dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych oot trôôch xok kanau đnoyq, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />nhonq xok varơuq xưh xadrah vii oot heq vih ka'lăk varơuq tavek adroyq nhưk ku oot. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Kung dii, oot kung hnoq ragơy katik alah, kưq kara truh hnhư neq hnhư hơq, đơu leh vơ katik alah, bơh măn katik đnooy ramôôy ji trôôch xalieh muut varơuq ku khơl drơy, đnooy kaluh varơuq oot be duh đnooy. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Vii anưq, gô trôôch khơl mo valơu măn blaay dayh pajêêk, pa iir koot, jư 'yo hnhư oot, xôq leh dơơp e kawah ka adro tachơơl e apok đnooy xơuq. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Vii muuyq sôôq adro heq klah vlôh hooy tyauq Sa-tan yôôch.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Atoh khơl kadrê tuôq Lôôk leq e mo valơu đom hnhư, yôôych dayh waak oot, ji te xôq Tayuup Vah biq pơq parêq, xôq ka Tayuup Vah hnoq ik waak khơl mo valơu dong dik.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Khơl adrah xet xakaq jư pheq jah 'yo laa đangq vado iaq đnoyq, nhưk laa khơl adro pơơl hwơơl đom Apok Lôôk ji varơuq pato dayq. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Vii Rahlăp Vah pato: “Koot te liq trôôp huuy ôô bo đong tuôôy ni joaq va,” ji “Manih dơơp hngơy taxưngq dii jêêt varơuq dơơp ku ni.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Te nhonq xok apok rôp kadrôôp tachơơl hlê muuyq dro khơl draq, đêh vlôh atoh gamưh tol axit nhưk laa vaarq long pe adro dơơp xanưk. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Dayh đnooy toah adro lôp kadrôôp kangưưr tôôy manih xôq khơl adro măn hlê hnoq ik kung xet yôq. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Gô đnooy pato dăt koot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kung khơl yaak plêêk jah rơơlh, đaneq koot pheq jư kaluh apok tanưưl neq đơu leh e xatyauq dii apok đnooy leq, be dơơp kajoq tyauq xuum bing pi leq.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Te pơl wơơl xôq ti tol akơyq, kung te dơơp tyauq muut kadrôôp maroh ku khơl drơy. Dayh jư xăk pa xarêh.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Koot te liq vơ hôôch daak, đơu dayh hôôch muuyq axit lok vii kơq vaduk ku koot ji kaluh dong bingq ragơy tavơh.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Kadrôôp ku muuyq sôôq adro yôôych ro raang, jarooy truh aduq xưh xadrah, bơh kung e kaluh kadrôôp vơ kahnoq vlôh atêq tuôôy xưh xadrah. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Dang anưq, kung e kaluh varơuq kaxay yôôych ro raang, măn kaluh varơuq kaxay e katik kachăk kadrơy yôôych be hnoq ik kưq jah padu kinq.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Paq kê akơyq đong măn 'laarq varaq dơơp xapok, pheq 'yo kôôch xăk laa đangq dêq xuum vado, xôq yal Kơy Plêêk ji varơuq pato dayq klơlh biq đnooy katơơk galơh. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Panưh kadrơy, khơl xapok e khơl adro kôôch laa khơl tuôq leh ik vii kơq oot laa oh ay đơu 'yo leh ra kajoq, bơh pheq hơu varơuq kang iaq đnoyq, vii oot laa khơl tuôq ji manih jah xung xiaq, manih jưq phon muut varơuq hơu varơuq. Koot dayh pato dayq ji ahmưk nhăk kaluh varơuq nưq.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Atoh adro leq pato dayq trôôk đêh ji leh tameng tyauq kaluh apok varơuq dik, 'ngưq laa apok ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kung dii apok pato truh varơuq tuôq kuh kul, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />yôôych manih nưq laa adro katơơk galơh, be hlolh xet kajoq, đơu e katik a'moh đom varơuq takaay tayaat ji takhelh truh chư valơk, xing nưq dơơp vlôh varơuq 'yarơ, tagoa, đnooy katơơk galơh, xuum biit va ih va oop, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />tagay tayaat, katul khơl adro biq va ih va oop đom xuum biit ji biq thiuq hlơơp varơuq dik, 'yo varơuq tuôq kuh kul laa aduq xôq dơơp karoh.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Bơh varơuq tuôq kuh kul kung dii varơuq hlah xuum laa muuyq lơơy kôt. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Vii haay heq leh xagook kajoq muut dêh araak, đơu haay kung be e hnoq xagook kajoq hooy ik. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Panưh kadrơy, tuôôy e pong xa, aau hlưp, yôôych haay hnoq jah hlah xuum dii kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Măn khơl adro trôôch jêêk vlôh karoh e yôôych gưlh muut adô aluut ji vơơt rayaalh, dii 'ngưng hmưch trôôch vlô apoop, taay haayq, 'ngưq laa kaluh thưq panheet karăp khơl drơy muut varơuq hruh hrek ji păk kaxêêt dêq. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Vii ưk rayah ku đu thưq varơuq xơk laa varơuq hmưch jêêt, đơu muuyq sôôq adro, vii thaal tajôh ni, heq biq aluut vlôh klơlh xuum tuôq ji dơơp ra ơơh ka xăk dii 'ngưng varơuq jiq hlu.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Bơh koot, manih ku Kơy Plêêk lơơy, dayh chuh xangưưy kaluh varơuq nưq, đơu charơơk tyauq varơuq hyioh jăk, tuôq kuh kul, xuum tuôq, xuum xung xiaq, katik wêêt kajưk, xuum tagu. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Dayh tathi đom varơuq charơơk kaxay tamaq ku xuum tuôq, dayh jư riit varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, laa varơuq đơu koot heq jah taayh truh ji heq kôk xuum vlôh apok xưng nhonq tolh kaxay kangưưr 'ngưng manih xanưk. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Gô vlôh tanưưl ka koot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, Kơy khienq ka kaluh paroh jah riirh, ji kangưưr Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Kơy đnooy vlôh apok xưng nhonq tolh kaxay aduq Bôn-xơ Phi-lat, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />đaneq koot pheq tameng jư apok pato dayq neq kach leh e tachoot, leh e aduq đnooy ik, dong truh hngơy rama vlôh ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />laa Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk Thier Yơơt đangq vanê ayuôôt ji vơ muuyq, laa Vuua ku khơl vuua ji Lôôk ku khơl lôôk, hnoq kahnoq vlôh muut klip kawat, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />vơ muuyq adro Kadraq e varơuq leh kaxêêt, măn đom varơuq tađnah leh truh jeq ik, ji Kơy be akơyq hmưq 'yo hloq, kung leh akơyq hnoq ik 'yo hloq, apôôy varơuq vado ji taay yaak đơơy đơơy awih xuq Kadraq. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Dayh pato dăt manih karoh đom đơơy neq te katơơk galơh, kung te takôô gamưh aduq garuh anôôp leh kajưk dik, đơu takôô gamưh aduq Kơy Plêêk, Kơy kahniq ka haay tôôy thưq kach galơh galaay xôq hlah nhonq, <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />ji pato dăt oot dơơp varơuq kaxay, raah jôh đom varơuq kaxay, e xuum ranưh ranơơy,ralauq palauq ahlook ăm, <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />tagoop xôq ka kadih xăk muuyq kahnier kaxay tamaq ka varơuq jeq truh, xôq oot hnoq ik jư riit varơuq riirh dik.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ti-mô-thê lơơy, koot dayh jư xok varơuq jah pahnăp ka koot, chuh xangưưy taleq apok taboon leh ik xung liq, ji kaluh takaay tayaat đnooy nưq laa hlolh xet, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />đơu taleq adro, vii đnooy vlôh đanưq, heq hooy hyaak trôôk xuum tuôq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Apôôy vanong plêêk măn kung khơl oh ay.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>